WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.970
A young woman in a white
dress walks a long,

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.820
white chalk road.

3
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.530
The road is cut into seven pieces.

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.900
Hardy calls them Phases.

5
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.710
Above her, the moon changes too.

6
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.250
At the end of the first,
one line stands alone:

7
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.790
"End of Phase the First".

8
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.100
Most novels make do with chapters.

9
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.050
So why cut her life into Phases?

10
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.110
In this mission, you'll
map all seven Phases,

11
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.280
and where Tess is in each.

12
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:35.300
You'll compare versions: a serial,
from 4 July to 26 December 1891,

13
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.850
cut for family readers, and the full book.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.300
And you'll stop at the edge of each Phase,

15
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.960
and ask why Hardy breaks it there.

16
00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.580
Your mission: work out
why Hardy chose Phases,

17
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.030
not just chapters.
